{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜香港法律周開幕／黃偉綸首次以署理局長身份出席立法會房屋事務委員會\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261102.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】香港法律周2026今日(11月2日)開幕，行政長官李家超、外交部駐港特派員崔建春等主持開幕禮。另外，立法會房屋事務委員會開會討論樓宇維修監管制度改革，黃偉綸首次以署理房屋局局長身份出席。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.630412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T23:22:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T19:26:47.372238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:39.939351+00:00","content_hash":"5aa0e4e208d302ce6a4fcdb46579db9d03d7802c3fdaa95482fc3161ea7cc597","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.630412+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}